			      <h3 class="news-card__title"><a href="https://www.dcm.co.uk/news/charles-reid-becomes-regional-md-as-dcm-doubles-manchester-office">Charles Reid becomes Regional MD as DCM doubles Manchester office</a></h3>
      <p class="news-card__excerpt">Charles held multiple senior positions across 15 years at Carat UK in Manchester, a global Dentsu marketing and advertising brand <a href="https://www.dcm.co.uk/news/charles-reid-becomes-regional-md-as-dcm-doubles-manchester-office" class="news-card__read-more">Read more</a></p>
