      <p class="news-card__excerpt">The 10th annual Digital Cinema Media Awards, held in partnership with Campaign, took place last night (Thursday 8 October) at BAFTA’s glamorous premises in Piccadilly to celebrate a decade of cinema advertising. <a href="https://www.dcm.co.uk/news/the-10th-digital-cinema-media-awards" class="news-card__read-more">Read more</a></p>
