      <p class="news-card__excerpt">With Support from UNICEF UK ambassador Michael Sheen, £1 from every Kids Club ticket sold will help to remove the barriers – a lack of health care, schooling, welfare – that prevent children reaching their potential. <a href="https://www.dcm.co.uk/news/picturehouse-kids-club-becomes-first-partner-for-unicef-uks-making-childhood-unstoppable-campaign" class="news-card__read-more">Read more</a></p>
